      ["PROGRESS"] = "Discover the Kheledûl Docks"; 
      ["LORE"] = "The ships which harboured at these docks once ferried goods along the western coast of Middle-earth to the White Mountains in the south. Now, the Dourhands use them to barter with the dark land of Angmar to the north."; 
