      ["LORE"] = "Before the gates to Asht-Shâpol lies Lagmas'  Court. From here, the Uruk-captain Lagmas and his second-in-command Morthang rally and muster the forces of Urugarth as they prepare to march upon Eriador."; 
      ["POINTS"] = {
