      ["LORE"] = "The Warg-pack of Urugarth calls this valley home. Led by the goblin-keeper Athpukh and the Warg Lâmkarn, these Wargs are ready to hunt the hills of Angmar at a moment's notice."; 
      ["POINTS"] = {
