      ["NAME"] = "Aslíf"; 
      ["PROGRESS"] = "Explore Aslíf"; 
      ["LORE"] = "Amidst the unfriendly dark of Deepscrave, the Gabil'akkâ have eked out a small place of respite. Aslíf clings to the Berg-beam, as if it is in danger of disappearing into the shadows that surround it."; 
