      ["NAME"] = "Scythe-sting"; 
      ["PROGRESS"] = "Find scythe-sting"; 
      ["LORE"] = "Scythe-sting is known for its deadly spikes which, seemingly with a mind of their own, break off of the stem and burrow under the skin of any unlucky enough to come into contact. At the heart of each spike lies a dormant seed, just waiting for the perfect, moist environment in which to thrive."; 
