      ["LORE"] = "The beacon of Dol Brannor stands in Dor-en-Ernil as a symbol of its strategic value to Central Gondor. Once home to an occupying force of Haradrim and Corsair, Dol Brannor has been freed once more into the stewardship of Gondor."; 
