      ["LORE"] = "Once a humble village of Gondor, taken over and assaulted by the Corsairs of Umbar. Many of its inhabitants have been displaced. The freedom of Dor-en-Ernil and how much value it has wanes the longer the Corsairs tighten their grip."; 
      ["POINTS"] = {
